### 1. 测试登录接口（用预置账号 test/123456）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/public/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "test",
    "password": "123456"
}

### 2. 测试注册接口
POST http://localhost:8080/api/public/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "zhangsan",
    "password": "123456",
    "nickname": "张三",
    "phone": "139****0000"
}

### 3. 测试获取物品列表（GET 接口示例）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/public/items
### 5. 测试发布物品接口
POST http://localhost:8080/api/public/item/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "丢失的校园卡",
    "type": "lost",
    "description": "姓名张三,卡号2023001,卡套是蓝色的",
    "location": "图书馆二楼自习室",
    "phone": "135****6789",
    "userid": 1
}